    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a solid start, really captures the contrast. I just checked the dashboard and the richness score for that one came back a bit lower than I wanted—around 0.25. Since the algorithm is what drives the visibility, we really need to push that density up.\n\nI know it sounds a bit technical, but can you try a rewrite? I'm looking for something much more \"dense.\" Basically, just pack in as many descriptive adjectives as you can to make the text feel incredibly lush and textured. Don't worry too much about the word count, just focus on making it as \"rich\" as possible for the scorer. Give it another go!",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
