      "content": "Behold this colossal, asymmetrical sculpture, a striking composition of rusted, variegated copper and fractured, volcanic obsidian. Jagged, piercing edges jut dramatically from the massive, grounded base, while shimmering, brilliant glass shards offer an ephemeral, airy luminosity. This formidable, intense artifact juxtaposes dark, earthy textures against dazzling, transparent highlights. Witness this profound, compelling exploration of rigid, elemental forms.",
      "source": "target",
